# public/images/ (the Met Museum starter set) IS committed — it's the
# zero-network fallback for a first run with no connection. Trimmed from 425
# images (96 MB) to 25 (7 MB) on 2026-08-08: at 105 MB the APK reliably hung
# Android's package installer, and by then eight live sources plus the offline
# download feature had made a large bundled set unnecessary. The full set is
# still in git history if it's ever wanted back.
# images_captioned/ is an unused experimental variant (add_captions.py) —
# stays ignored, not referenced by public/images.json.
/images_captioned/

